        "結果 $\\frac{\\Gamma(1/3)}{3}$。",
        "用遞迴改寫：$\\Gamma\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)=\\frac{1}{3}\\Gamma\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)$，所以答案也是 $\\Gamma\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)\\approx 0.8930$。這個值沒有更簡單的閉式。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{\\Gamma(1/3)}{3}=\\Gamma\\left(\\frac{4}{3}\\right)$",
      "claim": "INT(e^(-x^3), 0, inf) == INT(x^(1/3)*e^(-x), 0, inf) ;; INT(e^(-x^3), 0, inf) == INT(x^(-2/3)*e^(-x), 0, inf)/3"
    },
